
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Audio Watermarking Lab</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>

<style>
:root {
  --bg: #EAF1F4;
  --surface: #FFFFFF;
  --surface-alt: #F3F7F8;
  --text: #172B3A;
  --text-muted: #647783;
  --primary: #087F8C;
  --primary-hover: #066873;
  --accent: #D5A84C;
  --secondary: #4B9EAB;
  --border: #D5E0E5;
  --sidebar-bg: #172B3A;
  --sidebar-text: #EAF1F4;
  --success: #23866D;
  --danger: #C84C5A;
  --radius: 12px;
  --shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(23, 43, 58, .045);
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  font-size: 14px;
}

button, input, select { font: inherit; }
button { cursor: pointer; }

.app {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 238px minmax(0, 1fr);
}

.sidebar {
  background: var(--sidebar-bg);
  color: var(--sidebar-text);
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 25px 16px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  height: 100vh;
}

.brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  padding: 0 9px 28px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(234,241,244,.14);
}

.brand-mark {
  height: 38px;
  width: 38px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--primary);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  color: white;
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 800;
}

.brand-name {
  font: 800 17px "Manrope", sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: -.5px;
}

.brand-sub {
  font-size: 10px;
  color: #AFC2CC;
  letter-spacing: 1.3px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.nav-label {
  color: #91A8B5;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1.3px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 25px 10px 10px;
}

.nav-item {
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: #BFCED5;
  padding: 11px 12px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  width: 100%;
  text-align: left;
  margin: 2px 0;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.nav-item:hover {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  color: white;
}

.nav-item.active {
  background: rgba(8,127,140,.25);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: inset 3px 0 #39B5BD;
}

.nav-icon {
  font-size: 17px;
  width: 22px;
  text-align: center;
}

.sidebar-bottom {
  margin-top: auto;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(234,241,244,.14);
  padding: 18px 9px 0;
}

.status-dot {
  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #51C69A;
  display: inline-block;
  margin-right: 7px;
}

.sidebar-status {
  color: #C5D5DC;
  font-size: 11px;
}

.main { min-width: 0; }

.topbar {
  height: 66px;
  background: var(--surface);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 0 34px;
}

.breadcrumb {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

.breadcrumb strong { color: var(--text); }

.top-right {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 15px;
}

.tag {
  background: #E4F2F2;
  color: var(--primary);
  border-radius: 5px;
  padding: 6px 9px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .6px;
}

.avatar {
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #DDE7EA;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.content {
  max-width: 1500px;
  padding: 30px 34px 50px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.page-heading {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.eyebrow {
  color: var(--primary);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1.7px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 9px;
}

h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }

h1 {
  font: 800 clamp(25px, 3vw, 34px)/1.2 "Manrope", sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: -1.2px;
  margin-bottom: 9px;
}

.heading-description {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 650px;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.heading-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 9px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.btn {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 7px;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  background: white;
  color: var(--text);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 12px;
  transition: .15s ease;
}

.btn:hover { background: var(--surface-alt); }

.btn-primary {
  color: white;
  background: var(--primary);
  border-color: var(--primary);
}

.btn-primary:hover {
  background: var(--primary-hover);
  color: white;
}

.btn:disabled {
  opacity: .45;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

.btn-gold {
  background: #F8F0DC;
  color: #785A19;
  border-color: #E8D6A8;
}

.metrics {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}

.metric {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 18px 19px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.metric:before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  height: 3px;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  background: var(--primary);
}

.metric:nth-child(2):before { background: var(--accent); }
.metric:nth-child(3):before { background: var(--secondary); }
.metric:nth-child(4):before { background: #7B8E9B; }

.metric-label {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.metric-value {
  font: 600 26px "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
  letter-spacing: -1px;
}

.metric-foot {
  margin-top: 8px;
  color: #81919A;
  font-size: 10px;
}

.layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(310px, .92fr);
  gap: 19px;
  align-items: start;
}

.column {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 19px;
  min-width: 0;
}

.panel {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  overflow: hidden;
  min-width: 0;
}

.panel-header {
  padding: 17px 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
}

.panel-title {
  font: 700 14px "Manrope", sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: -.25px;
  margin: 0;
}

.panel-subtitle {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.panel-body { padding: 20px; }

.step-number {
  display: inline-grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 25px;
  height: 25px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  background: #E4F2F2;
  color: var(--primary);
  font: 600 12px "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
  margin-right: 8px;
}

.upload-area {
  border: 1.5px dashed #B9CBD2;
  background: #F8FAFB;
  padding: 24px 15px;
  text-align: center;
  border-radius: 9px;
  transition: .2s;
}

.upload-area.dragover {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  background: #E4F2F2;
}

.upload-icon {
  width: 43px;
  height: 43px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: #E4F2F2;
  color: var(--primary);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  margin: 0 auto 12px;
  font-size: 22px;
}

.upload-title {
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.upload-description {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.upload-filename {
  font: 11px "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin-top: 10px;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.file-input { display: none; }

.section-label {
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1.1px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.field { margin-bottom: 18px; }
.field:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

.field-label {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 9px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.field-value {
  color: var(--primary);
  font: 500 11px "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
}

input[type="text"], input[type="number"], select {
  width: 100%;
  background: #FAFCFC;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--text);
  border-radius: 7px;
  padding: 10px 11px;
  outline: none;
}

input:focus, select:focus {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(8,127,140,.1);
}

input[type="range"] {
  width: 100%;
  accent-color: var(--primary);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.field-help {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.two-col {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
}

.action-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 9px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 18px;
}

.action-row .btn { flex: 1; }

.signal-canvas {
  width: 100%;
  height: 150px;
  display: block;
}

.chart-caption {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  margin-top: 9px;
}

.chart-wrap {
  position: relative;
  height: 215px;
  width: 100%;
}

.chart-wrap.short { height: 185px; }

.chart-legend {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 10px;
}

.legend-dot {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 2px;
  margin-right: 5px;
}

.notice {
  padding: 12px 14px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  background: #F8F3E6;
  border: 1px solid #E9DDBB;
  color: #735D2B;
}

.notice.teal {
  background: #EAF5F5;
  border-color: #C7E5E6;
  color: #23666C;
}

.notice.success {
  background: #EAF6F0;
  border-color: #C6E7D5;
  color: #236B51;
}

.progress-track {
  height: 5px;
  background: #E2E9EC;
  border-radius: 99px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  width: 0%;
  background: var(--primary);
  transition: width .2s;
}

.progress-text {
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-top: 7px;
}

.hidden { display: none !important; }

.results-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 10px;
}

.result-box {
  background: var(--surface-alt);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 13px;
}

.result-label {
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 7px;
}

.result-value {
  font: 500 19px "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
}

.result-unit {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font: 10px "DM Sans", sans-serif;
}

.log {
  background: #172B3A;
  color: #D5E4E9;
  padding: 14px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  height: 145px;
  overflow: auto;
  font: 10px/1.8 "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
}

.log-line { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.log-time { color: #86B9BE; }
.log-ok { color: #92D8B7; }
.log-warn { color: #E8C875; }
.log-error { color: #F19AA3; }

.footer {
  padding-top: 27px;
  text-align: center;
  color: #84949D;
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .app { grid-template-columns: 190px minmax(0,1fr); }
  .content { padding: 24px 22px 40px; }
  .topbar { padding: 0 22px; }
  .metrics { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
  .layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
}

@media (max-width: 650px) {
  .app { display: block; }
  .sidebar {
    position: relative;
    height: auto;
    min-height: 0;
    padding: 14px;
  }
  .brand { padding: 0 5px 12px; border: 0; }
  .nav-label, .sidebar-bottom { display: none; }
  .sidebar nav {
    display: flex;
    overflow-x: auto;
    gap: 5px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .nav-item {
    width: auto;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 9px 10px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .nav-item.active { box-shadow: inset 0 -3px #39B5BD; }
  .nav-item span:last-child { font-size: 11px; }
  .topbar { height: 52px; padding: 0 15px; }
  .content { padding: 22px 14px 35px; }
  .page-heading { flex-direction: column; }
  .heading-actions { width: 100%; }
  .heading-actions .btn { flex: 1; }
  .metrics { gap: 9px; }
  .metric { padding: 14px; }
  .metric-value { font-size: 21px; }
  .panel-body { padding: 15px; }
  .panel-header { padding: 14px 15px; }
  .two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .chart-wrap { height: 185px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="app">
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-mark">∿</div>
      <div>
        <div class="brand-name">WaveLab</div>
        <div class="brand-sub">Audio Research Tools</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="nav-label">Workspace</div>
    <nav>
      <button class="nav-item active" data-section="workspace">
        <span class="nav-icon">▦</span><span>Overview</span>
      </button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-section="watermark">
        <span class="nav-icon">⌁</span><span>Watermarking</span>
      </button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-section="attacks">
        <span class="nav-icon">⌇</span><span>Attack Testing</span>
      </button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-section="analysis">
        <span class="nav-icon">◫</span><span>Signal Analysis</span>
      </button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-section="results">
        <span class="nav-icon">▤</span><span>Results & Logs</span>
      </button>
    </nav>

    <div class="nav-label">Information</div>
    <button class="nav-item" id="aboutBtn">
      <span class="nav-icon">ⓘ</span><span>About the Lab</span>
    </button>

    <div class="sidebar-bottom">
      <div class="sidebar-status"><span class="status-dot"></span>Processing engine ready</div>
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:#91A8B5;margin-top:8px;">LOCAL AUDIO PROCESSING</div>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <main class="main">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="breadcrumb">Research tools / <strong>Audio Watermarking</strong></div>
      <div class="top-right">
        <span class="tag">DSP Laboratory</span>
        <div class="avatar">WL</div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="content" id="workspace">
      <div class="page-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Digital signal processing · Experiment 01</div>
          <h1>Audio Watermarking Lab</h1>
          <p class="heading-description">
            Embed a digital signature into audio, challenge it with common signal-processing attacks,
            and evaluate how reliably the watermark survives.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="heading-actions">
          <button class="btn" id="resetBtn">Reset experiment</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" id="demoBtn">Load demo audio ↗</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="metrics">
        <div class="metric">
          <div class="metric-label">Watermark BER</div>
          <div class="metric-value" id="metricBer">—</div>
          <div class="metric-foot">Bit error rate after extraction</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric">
          <div class="metric-label">Audio SNR</div>
          <div class="metric-value" id="metricSnr">—</div>
          <div class="metric-foot">Signal-to-noise ratio</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric">
          <div class="metric-label">Audio PSNR</div>
          <div class="metric-value" id="metricPsnr">—</div>
          <div class="metric-foot">Peak signal-to-noise ratio</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric">
          <div class="metric-label">Watermark size</div>
          <div class="metric-value" id="metricBits">—</div>
          <div class="metric-foot">Payload bits embedded</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="layout">
        <div class="column">
          <section class="panel" id="watermark">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <h2 class="panel-title"><span class="step-number">01</span>Audio source</h2>
                <div class="panel-subtitle">Choose an audio file to start the experiment</div>
              </div>
              <span class="tag">Input</span>
            </div>
            <div class="panel-body">
              <div class="upload-area" id="uploadArea">
                <div class="upload-icon">⇧</div>
                <div class="upload-title">Drop your audio file here</div>
                <div class="upload-description">or choose a file from your device<br>WAV, MP3 and M4A supported by your browser</div>
                <div style="margin-top:14px">
                  <button class="btn btn-primary" id="chooseFileBtn">Browse files</button>
                </div>
                <div class="upload-filename" id="fileName">No audio loaded</div>
                <input class="file-input" type="file" id="audioFile" accept="audio/*">
              </div>

              <div style="margin-top:20px">
                <div class="section-label">Input signal</div>
                <canvas class="signal-canvas" id="inputWave"></canvas>
                <div class="chart-caption">
                  <span id="audioInfo">Awaiting audio source</span>
                  <span id="durationInfo">Duration: —</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <h2 class="panel-title"><span class="step-number">02</span>Watermark configuration</h2>
                <div class="panel-subtitle">Define the signature and embedding strength</div>
              </div>
              <span class="tag">Encode</span>
            </div>
            <div class="panel-body">
              <div class="field">
                <label class="field-label" for="watermarkText">Watermark message</label>
                <input type="text" id="watermarkText" value="WAVELAB-2026" maxlength="64" placeholder="Enter a short watermark">
                <div class="field-help">The message is converted to bits before embedding. Shorter messages are easier to recover.</div>
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label class="field-label" for="strength">
                  <span>Embedding strength</span>
                  <span class="field-value" id="strengthValue">0.080</span>
                </label>
                <input type="range" id="strength" min="0.005" max="0.12" step="0.005" value="0.08">
                <div class="field-help">Higher strength can improve recovery but may increase audible distortion.</div>
              </div>

              <div class="two-col">
                <div class="field">
                  <label class="field-label" for="fftSize">FFT frame size</label>
                  <select id="fftSize">
                    <option value="512">512 samples</option>
                    <option value="1024" selected>1024 samples</option>
                    <option value="2048">2048 samples</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label class="field-label" for="repeatBits">Bit repetition</label>
                  <select id="repeatBits">
                    <option value="1">1× — compact</option>
                    <option value="3" selected>3× — balanced</option>
                    <option value="5">5× — robust</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="notice teal">
                <strong>Method:</strong> FFT magnitude quantization. The algorithm modifies selected spectral magnitudes
                and uses a synchronized key pattern for extraction. This is an educational prototype, not a cryptographic
                or production-grade watermarking system.
              </div>

              <div class="action-row">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" id="embedBtn" disabled>Embed watermark</button>
                <button class="btn" id="extractBtn" disabled>Extract watermark</button>
              </div>
              <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill"></div></div>
              <div class="progress-text" id="progressText">Load an audio file or demo to begin.</div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="panel" id="attacks">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <h2 class="panel-title"><span class="step-number">03</span>Attack simulation</h2>
                <div class="panel-subtitle">Test the watermark against common transformations</div>
              </div>
              <span class="tag">Robustness</span>
            </div>
            <div class="panel-body">
              <div class="field">
                <label class="field-label" for="attackType">Attack type</label>
                <select id="attackType">
                  <option value="none">No attack — baseline</option>
                  <option value="noise">Additive white Gaussian noise</option>
                  <option value="lowpass">Low-pass filtering</option>
                  <option value="resample">Resampling / sample-rate change</option>
